</execute_read>','{"timeline":[{"kind":"model","messageCount":97,"mode":"plain_summary","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","phase":"interrupted","seq":94,"step":-1},{"kind":"model","messageCount":3,"mode":"tools_stream","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","phase":"responded","seq":1,"step":0},{"allowed":true,"arguments":{"name":"vm-xagent-log-search"},"decision":"allowed","id":"call_86fd69c939094719b50292ec","kind":"tool","phase":"completed","result":"---\nname: vm-xagent-log-search\ndescription: 通过查询数据库获取 VM 信息，并调用 xagent 接口搜索指定 trace_id 的日志。当用户需要在虚拟机日志中搜索特定 trace_id 时使用。优先使用 trace_id 搜索，尽量覆盖 startGame 和 endGame 两个关键操作。\nallowed_tools:\n  - load_skill\n  - read_skill_file\n  - execute_skill_script\n---\n\n# VM xagent 日志搜索技能\n\n### 最佳实践：使用 trace_id 而非 flow_id\n- 排查 VM 端日志时应优先使用 trace_id 而非 flow_id 进行过滤。trace_id 是 xagent 日志中最精确的关联标识，flow_id 可能匹配不完整或匹配到无关日志。\n- 搜索前应通过 Jaeger 或 ES 服务日志提取 startGame 和 endGame 两个关键 trace_id。\n\n## 技能逻辑\n\n当你收到用户关于\"在 VM 日志中搜索 trace_id\"的查询时，请严格遵循以下步骤执行。\n\n### 第一步：获取必要信息\n\n从用户输入中提取以下关键信息：\n- **`vmid`** (必需): 需要排查的虚拟机 ID。\n- **`trace_id`** (必需): 需要在日志中搜索的 trace ID。**优先使用 trace_id 作为搜索关键字**，trace_id 是 xagent 日志中最精确的关联标识。\n\n\u003e **重要**：如果用户只提供了 `flow_id` 或 `vmid` 而没有 `trace_id`，应先通过 Jaeger（`jaeger_trace`）或 ES 日志（`execute_read`）查找该 flow 关联的 trace_id，**优先找到 startGame 和 endGame 两个关键操作的 trace_id**，再执行本技能的搜索流程。\n\n### 第二步：查询数据库获取 VM 信息\n\n使用已绑定的数据源 `yuanli_msyql_pro` 查询 VM 信息，**无需向用户索取任何数据库凭据**。\n\n```sql\nSELECT \n    vmid,\n    mgr_ipv4_address,\n    stream_ipv4_address,\n    online_state,\n    assign_state,\n    g_instance_id\nFROM d_1000_game_virtual_machine_info\nWHERE vmid = :vmid\n```\n\n如果查询结果为空，告知用户该 vmid 不存在。\n\n### 第三步：确定搜索的 trace_id 列表\n\n**优先使用 trace_id 进行搜索**。按以下优先级收集 trace_id：\n\n1. **用户直接提供的 trace_id** → 直接使用\n2. **从 Jaeger 链路追踪中提取**：搜索该 flow_id 相关的所有 trace，提取 startGame 和 endGame 的 trace_id\n3. **从 ES 服务日志中提取**：搜索 cgsession / sched-hub 日志中该 flow 关联的 trace_id\n\n**目标**：至少获取 **startGame 的 trace_id** 和 **endGame 的 trace_id** 两个，以便完整覆盖 VM 端的游戏生命周期。\n\n### 第四步：调用 xagent 接口搜索日志（按 trace_id）\n\n对每个 trace_id，向 VM 的 xagent 服务发送 POST 请求：\n\n```\nPOST http://{mgr_ipv4_address}:49997/v1/taskmanager/exec?shell=ps\nHeader: X-VMID={vmid}\nBody: Get-Content -Path D:\\CloudGameBundle\\apps\\cgvmagent\\current\\logs\\*.log | Select-String {trace_id} | Select-Object -Last 100\n```\n\n**搜索顺序**：\n1. 先用 startGame 的 trace_id 搜索，获取 StartGame 各阶段日志（InitUserArchive → 存档下载 → 存档部署 → GSM 启动 → 上报完成）\n2. 再用 endGame 的 trace_id 搜索，获取 EndGame 各阶段日志（gameClosed → 存档卸载 → 上传 → 释放）\n3. 如果只有一个 trace_id，则用该 trace_id 搜索全部日志\n\n### 第五步：返回原始结果\n\n将每次 HTTP 请求的完整响应（状态码、body）原样返回给调用方，**不做分析和汇总**，供下游流程使用。\n\n**返回时标注**：\n- 每条结果对应的 trace_id 和操作类型（startGame / endGame / 其他）\n- 如果某个 trace_id 搜索无结果，明确标注\"trace_id=xxx 在 xagent 日志中无匹配\"","seq":2,"step":0,"toolName":"load_skill"},{"allowed":true,"arguments":{"datasource_id":"pro_mysql_vm_tool"},"decision":"allowed","durationMs":237,"id":"call_4b8126f0e0254ab897932ccd","kind":"tool","phase":"completed","result":[{"name":"t_game_virtual_machine_multiopen_extend_info"},{"name":"t_xma_linux_container_info"},{"name":"t_game_virtual_machine_assign_extend_info"},{"name":"t_game_virtual_machine_extend_info"},{"name":"t_game_virtual_machine_info"},{"name":"t_game_virtual_machine_instance_info"},{"name":"t_user_debug_mode_info"},{"name":"t_xma_linux_container_info_old"},{"name":"t_game_virtual_machine_extend_info_gorm"},{"name":"t_game_virtual_machine_flex_instance_info"},{"name":"t_game_virtual_machine_idc_power_info"},{"name":"t_game_virtual_machine_port_info"},{"name":"t_idc_power_info"},{"name":"t_game_virtual_machine_debug_mode_info"},{"name":"t_game_virtual_machine_game_pool_config"},{"name":"t_game_virtual_machine_game_pool_info"},{"name":"t_game_virtual_machine_info_test"}],"seq":3,"step":0,"toolName":"list_tables"},{"kind":"model","messageCount":6,"mode":"tools_stream","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","phase":"responded","seq":4,"step":1},{"allowed":true,"arguments":{"datasource_id":"pro_mysql_vm_tool","table_name":"t_game_virtual_machine_info"},"decision":"allowed","id":"call_7a591050c25b4d55ad68fae5","kind":"tool","phase":"completed","result":{"name":"t_game_virtual_machine_info","columns":[{"name":"vmid","type":"bigint","is_nullable":false,"comment":"游戏虚拟机id"},{"name":"area_type","type":"smallint","is_nullable":false,"comment":"分区，用于接入管理"},{"name":"sub_area_type","type":"smallint","is_nullable":false,"comment":"子分区，用于接入管理"},{"name":"inner_mac_address","type":"char","is_nullable":false,"comment":"内部通讯MAC地址，具有唯一性"},{"name":"outer_mac_address","type":"char","is_nullable":false,"comment":"外部通讯MAC地址，具有唯一性"},{"name":"hmid","type":"bigint","is_nullable":false,"comment":"运行游戏主机id"},{"name":"vm_type","type":"smallint","is_nullable":false,"comment":"虚拟机类型，此值和host_device_set里的vm_type保持一致，0-未知；1-高端游戏机；2-主流游戏机；3-2D游戏机"},{"name":"name","type":"char","is_nullable":false,"comment":"虚拟机名称，命名方式：{area_type}_{hmid}_{device_set_id}_{vm_type}"},{"name":"host_device_set","type":"json","is_nullable":true,"comment":"使用的主机设备列表"},{"name":"online_state","type":"smallint","is_nullable":false,"comment":"在线状态，0-未知；1-待初始化；2-初始化中；3-启动中；4-运行中；5-挂起中；6-已挂起；7-关机中；8-已关机；9-销毁中；10-已销毁"},{"name":"mgr_state","type":"smallint","is_nullable":false,"comment":"管理状态，0-未知；1-允许使用；2-暂停使用；3-允许升级；4-允许调试；5-允许管理；"},{"name":"os_state","type":"smallint","is_nullable":false,"comment":"操作系统状态，0-未知；1-启动中；2-健康可用；3-异常不可用；4-关机中；5-已关机；6-重启中；7-windows已经启动"},{"name":"assign_state","type":"smallint","is_nullable":false,"comment":"分配状态，0-未知；1-未分配；2-预分配；3-占用中；4-空闲中；5-回收中"},{"name":"assign_uid","type":"bigint","is_nullable":false,"comment":"分配的用户id"},{"name":"assign_gid","type":"bigint","is_nullable":false,"comment":"分配的游戏id"},{"name":"assign_resource_type","type":"bigint","is_nullable":false,"comment":"分配的资源类型"},{"name":"assign_rno","type":"bigint","is_nullable":false,"comment":"分配的房间id"},{"name":"vmoiid","type":"bigint","is_nullable":false,"comment":"运行的虚拟机镜像id"},{"name":"image_version","type":"smallint","is_nullable":false,"comment":"镜像版本"},{"name":"total_image_size","type":"bigint","is_nullable":false,"comment":"总虚拟机系统镜像存储空间大小，单位KB"},{"name":"mgr_ipv4_address","type":"char","is_nullable":false,"comment":"虚拟机管理ipv4地址"},{"name":"stream_ipv4_address","type":"char","is_nullable":false,"comment":"虚拟机游戏流ipv4地址"},{"name":"stream_ipv4_port","type":"int","is_nullable":false,"comment":"虚拟机游戏端口"},{"name":"stream_method","type":"smallint","is_nullable":false,"comment":"支持串流方式，0-兼容（GFE）；1-LS；2-GFE；3-GFE和LS； 4-GFE和LS都不可用"},{"name":"gfe_version","type":"bigint","is_nullable":false,"comment":"GFE 版本号，版本号需从字符串换算为整数，如2.1.6 换算为 2001006"},{"name":"ls_version","type":"bigint","is_nullable":false,"comment":"LS 版本号，版本号需从字符串换算为整数，如2.1.6 换算为 2001006"},{"name":"cache_id","type":"bigint","is_nullable":false,"comment":"缓存存储ID"},{"name":"create_time","type":"datetime","is_nullable":false},{"name":"update_time","type":"datetime","is_nullable":false},{"name":"modify_time","type":"datetime","is_nullable":false},{"name":"tags","type":"varchar","is_nullable":false,"comment":"标签,所有tag按逗号分隔 如:jifang_8001,test_2"},{"name":"flow_id","type":"varchar","is_nullable":false,"comment":"分配的流水id"},{"name":"multi_id","type":"int","is_nullable":false,"comment":"多开路数，0为第一路。单开时为-1"},{"name":"g_instance_id","type":"bigint","is_nullable":false,"comment":"宿主机ID"}]},"seq":5,"step":1,"toolName":"describe_table"},{"allowed":true,"arguments":{"name":"scheduling-flow-trace"},"decision":"allowed","id":"call_9353aad83418432a9a7f5bd4","kind":"tool","phase":"completed","result":"\"---\\nname: scheduling-flow-trace\\ndescription: 通过 ES 日志、Jaeger 链路追踪和数据库，端到端排查两套调度系统的失败原因。老系统：union-access → union-resource → vm-manager（资源分配）；新系统：cgsession → sched-hub → cgvmagent（游戏调度）。当用户提供 trace_id / flow_id 并询问调度失败、分配 VM 失败、资源占用、锁定超时等问题时使用。\\nallowed_tools:\\n  - load_skill\\n  - read_skill_file\\n  - execute_skill_script\\n  - execute_read\\n  - list_tables\\n  - describe_table\\n  - http_request\\n  - jaeger_trace\\n  - rca_grep\\n  - rca_glob\\n  - rca_read\\n---\\n\\n# 调度全链路追踪排查技能\\n\\n### 排查原则\\n- **先取证，后结论**：必须先调用 Jaeger 链路追踪 + ES 日志查询（http_request）收集运行时证据，再下结论。若两者均无结果，必须在报告中明确写「证据不足」或 \\\"insufficient evidence\\\"，不得基于推断判定根因。\\n- **data-channel 任务残留**：当 data-channel 返回 result=20504 \\\"任务已经存在\\\" 时，说明同一个 task_id 已在 data-channel 中存在但未被清理。需检查：1) 该 task_id 是否属于更早的已完成/canceled 流程；2) data-channel 的 cancel 后清理逻辑是否正常。相同参数组合 (src_uid, src_gid, src_version) 会导致 data-channel 认为是重复任务。\\n\\n## 适用场景\\n\\n当用户提供 **trace_id** 或 **flow_id**，询问以下问题时使用本技能：\\n- 调度失败 / 分配 VM 失败\\n- 资源占用 / 锁定超时\\n- 用户无法进入游戏\\n- 调度链路中任意环节的异常排查\\n\\n## 系统架构速查\\n\\n\\u003e **本项目包含两套独立的调度系统，分别对应不同场景。**\\n\\n### 老调度系统：资源分配链路\\n\\n\\u003e 负责 VM 资源的锁定与分配，返回 VMID 给上游。是整个调度流程的**第一阶段**，先于新调度系统执行。\\n\\u003e 链路：`union-access → union-resource → vm-manager`。\\n\\u003e \\n\\u003e **完整拓扑、三阶段时序、代码位置、API 切换**：`read_skill_file(\\\"scheduling-flow-trace\\\", \\\"references/old-scheduling-system.md\\\")`\\n\\n**速查**：入口 `ApplyToken`，调度 `union_resource /v1/schedule`，锁定 `vm_manager lock_vm`，启动 `assign_vm/prepare`，释放 `release_vm → DoSlowLockReleaseVm`。`isNewScheduleVersion` 仅切换 API 路径，不影响拓扑。\\n\\n### 新调度系统：游戏调度链路\\n\\n\\u003e 负责将已分配的 VM 与用户 session 绑定，启动/结束游戏。链路：`cgsession → sched-hub → cgvmagent`，不经过 vm-manager。\\n\\u003e \\n\\u003e **完整拓扑、6阶段时序、代码位置、新旧对比**：`read_skill_file(\\\"scheduling-flow-trace\\\", \\\"references/new-scheduling-system.md\\\")`\\n\\n**速查**：gRPC 入口 `UserApplyAdapter`，调度 `sched-hub.Schedule`，Kafka 异步回传 `schedule_result_topic`，HTTP 启动 `cgvmagent /v1/cgagent/game/startGame`，WebSocket 通知 `NtfGameStatus`。\\n\\n### 释放链路\\n\\n```\\ncgsession (release_type/reason) → vm-manager (DoSlowLockReleaseVmWorker)\\n```\\n\\n### 预启动链路\\n\\n```\\nsched-planner → cgvmagent (preLaunchGame)\\n```\\n\\n## 核心 ES 索引\\n\\n### 老调度系统（资源分配）\\n\\n| 索引 | 对应服务 | 关键日志内容 |\\n|------|----------|-------------|\\n| `backend-union-access-*` | union-access | 调度入口、ApplyToken、UserStateAdapter |\\n| `backend-union_resource-*` | union-resource | Schedule、ApplyArea、lockResourceAdapt、RedLock |\\n| `backend-vm_manager-*` | vm-manager | ResourceVMLock、DoResourceVMLock、DoSlowLockReleaseVm |\\n\\n### 新调度系统（游戏调度）\\n\\n| 索引 | 对应服务 | 关键日志内容 |\\n|------|----------|-------------|\\n| `backend-cgsession-*` | cgsession | session Release、endGame、startGame、ScheduleResultNotify |\\n| `backend-sched-hub-*` | sched-hub | MatchRule、AllocVM、QueueUsecase |\\n| `backend-sched-planner-*` | sched-planner | preLaunchGame、Execute、UPSchedule |\\n\\n### 索引 Mapping 字段差异（⚠️ 搜索前必查）\\n\\n\\u003e **不同索引的 `flow_id` / `trace_id` 存储位置不同，直接用字段名搜索会导致大量漏报。**\\n\\n| 索引 | `flow_id` 字段 | `trace_id` 字段 | 实际存储位置 |\\n|------|:---:|:---:|------|\\n| `backend-union_resource-*` | ✅ 显式 | ✅ 显式 | 顶层字段 + `M` 消息体 |\\n| `backend-union-access-*` | ❌ | ❌ | 仅嵌入 `M`（消息体 JSON 字符串） |\\n| `backend-vm_manager-*` | ❌ | ❌ | 仅嵌入 `M`（消息体 JSON 字符串） |\\n| `backend-cgsession-*` | ❌ | ❌ | 仅嵌入 `M`（消息体 JSON 字符串） |\\n| `backend-sched-hub-*` | ❌ | ❌ | 仅嵌入 `M`（消息体 JSON 字符串） |\\n| `backend-sched-planner-*` | ❌ | ❌ | 仅嵌入 `M`（消息体 JSON 字符串） |\\n\\n**搜索策略**：先用 `query_string` 搜索 `M` 字段（全索引通吃），再对 `union_resource` 用 `flow_id` 精确匹配。不要在未查 mapping 的情况下直接用 `flow_id` 字段搜索非 `union_resource` 的索引。\\n\\n## Jaeger 链路追踪\\n\\n### 支持 Jaeger 的服务\\n\\n| 服务 | Jaeger 状态 | 典型 Span 操作 | 所属系统 |\\n|------|------------|---------------|----------|\\n| **union-access** | ✅ 可用 | `ApplyToken`、`doQGroupLoadQueue`、`GetZoneSvcApInfo` | 老调度 |\\n| **union_resource** | ✅ 可用 | `/v1/schedule` | 老调度 |\\n| **vm_manager** | ✅ 可用 | `/v1/vm_manager/batch_assign_gp_vm` | 老调度 |\\n| **cgsession** | ✅ 可用 | `processSessionCheck`、`ReqLaunchRank(sdk)`、`QueryQueueStatus`、`/v1/cgagent/game/endGame` | 新调度 |\\n| **sched-hub** | ✅ 可用 | `QueryQueueStatus` | 新调度 |\\n| **sched-planner** | ✅ 可用 | `Execute`、`preLaunchGame`、`getGameInfo` | 预启动 |\\n| **area-ap-manager** | ✅ 可用 | 区域 AP 管理 | 关联服务 |\\n| **cgvmagent** | ❌ 无 Jaeger | — | 新调度（VM 端） |\\n\\n### Jaeger 搜索方法\\n\\n```bash\\n# 按 trace_id 精确搜索（推荐首选）\\njaeger_trace(trace_id=\\\"0_5q4jd565xgwq\\\")\\n\\n# 按服务名搜索（查看最近链路）\\njaeger_trace(service=\\\"cgsession\\\", limit=10)\\njaeger_trace(service=\\\"sched-hub\\\", limit=10)\\njaeger_trace(service=\\\"union-access\\\", limit=10)\\n\\n# 按服务+操作名组合搜索\\njaeger_trace(service=\\\"cgsession\\\", operation=\\\"ReqLaunchRank\\\")\\n```\\n\\n**注意**：`cgvmagent` 没有 Jaeger span 上报。如需排查 VM 端的实际行为（startGame/endGame 是否执行），需加载 `vm-xagent-log-search` 技能查 VM 上的 xagent 日志。\\n\\n## 代码仓库搜索\\n\\n代码仓库已配置为 `cloudgame`，使用以下工具组合搜索源码定位问题。\\n\\n### 按关键字搜索代码内容 (`rca_grep`)\\n\\n```bash\\n# 搜索特定错误码的处理逻辑\\nrca_grep(pattern=\\\"4021\\\", glob=\\\"*.go\\\")\\n\\n# 搜索 Jaeger/OpenTelemetry 相关配置\\nrca_grep(pattern=\\\"jaeger|opentelemetry|otel\\\", glob=\\\"*.go\\\")\\n\\n# 搜索特定函数/方法\\nrca_grep(pattern=\\\"DoResourceVMLock|preLaunchGame|ApplyToken|lockResourceAdapt\\\", glob=\\\"*.go\\\")\\n\\n# 限定仓库搜索\\nrca_grep(pattern=\\\"trace_id\\\", glob=\\\"*.go\\\", repo=\\\"cloudgame\\\")\\n```\\n\\n### 按文件名搜索 (`rca_glob`)\\n\\n```bash\\nrca_glob(pattern=\\\"*.proto\\\")        # 所有 protobuf 定义\\nrca_glob(pattern=\\\"*vm*\\\")           # VM 相关文件\\nrca_glob(pattern=\\\"*session*\\\")      # Session 相关文件\\n```\\n\\n### 读取具体文件 (`rca_read`)\\n\\n```bash\\nrca_read(repo=\\\"cloudgame\\\", file=\\\"vm-manager/internal/service/xxx.go\\\", start_line=1)\\n```\\n\\n### 仓库中已识别的服务模块\\n\\n| 目录 | 服务 |\\n|------|------|\\n| `access-service/` | union-access（调度入口） |\\n| `api-gateway/` | API 网关 |\\n| `api-proto/` | 公共 protobuf 定义 |\\n| `area-resource-collector/` | 区域资源采集器 |\\n| `backend-go-public/` | 公共库（含 otelwrap、httpwrap） |\\n| `vm-manager/` | VM 管理器 |\\n| `rock-stack/` | 包含 cgarchive、cgboss 等 |\\n\\n## 关键错误码速查\\n\\n### union-resource 错误码 (URError)\\n\\n| 错误码 | 含义 | 常见原因 |\\n|--------|------|----------|\\n| 30055 | 资源占用中 | vm-manager 返回 4021，VM 被其他 session 锁定 |\\n| …[truncated]","seq":6,"step":1,"toolName":"load_skill","truncated":true},{"kind":"model","messageCount":9,"mode":"tools_stream","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","phase":"responded","seq":7,"step":2},{"allowed":true,"arguments":{"datasource_id":"pro_mysql_vm_tool","dsl":"SELECT vmid, name, mgr_ipv4_address, stream_ipv4_address, online_state, assign_state, assign_uid, assign_gid, flow_id, area_type, g_instance_id, create_time, update_time FROM t_game_virtual_machine_info WHERE name = ''4103_TMuvu0uu5v2E'' OR flow_id = ''4103_TMuvu0uu5v2E''"},"decision":"allowed","durationMs":42,"id":"call_27fc3db4fee2492183823ec7","kind":"tool","phase":"completed","result":{"Columns":["vmid","name","mgr_ipv4_address","stream_ipv4_address","online_state","assign_state","assign_uid","assign_gid","flow_id","area_type","g_instance_id","create_time","update_time"],"Rows":[[219345,"219345_4103_8587_154335","10.167.56.45","10.167.56.45",4,3,619633397,46332,"4103_TMuvu0uu5v2E",4103,0,"2026-07-17 14:09:56","2026-08-05 10:50:38"]],"Truncated":false,"EstimatedTotal":0},"seq":8,"step":2,"toolName":"execute_read"},{"kind":"model","messageCount":11,"mode":"tools_stream","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","phase":"responded","seq":9,"step":3},{"allowed":true,"arguments":{"trace_id":"4103_TMuvu0uu5v2E"},"decision":"allowed","durationMs":45,"id":"call_70397417032f4615b360188f","kind":"tool","phase":"completed","result":{"error":"jaeger returned 400: {\"data\":null,\"total\":0,\"limit\":0,\"offset\":0,\"errors\":[{\"code\":400,\"msg\":\"strconv.ParseUint: parsing \\\"103_TMuvu0uu5v2E\\\": invalid syntax\"}]}","error_code":"permanent","ok":false},"seq":10,"step":3,"toolName":"jaeger_trace"},{"allowed":true,"arguments":{"name":"scheduling-flow-trace","path":"references/new-scheduling-system.md"},"decision":"allowed","id":"call_85844abe7c034a4b8849970f","kind":"tool","phase":"completed","result":"\"# 新调度系统：游戏调度链路\\n\\n\\u003e 负责将已分配的 VM 与用户 session 绑定，启动/结束游戏。是独立于老系统的**另一条链路**，不经过 vm-manager。\\n\\n## 宏观拓扑\\n\\n```\\nClient\\n  │\\n  ▼\\nunion-access  ← 统一入口 (所有请求的第一跳)\\n  │\\n  │  gRPC ──► cgsession.AdapterService\\n  │              │\\n  │              ├── gRPC ──► sched-hub.ScheduleService  (调度决策)\\n  │              │              │\\n  │              │              └── Kafka produce ──► schedule_result_topic\\n  │              │\\n  │              ├── Kafka consume ◄── schedule_result_topic  (异步结果)\\n  │              │\\n  │              ├── HTTP ──► cgvmagent  (VM Agent: startGame / endGame)\\n  │              │\\n  │              ├── HTTP ──► charge  (计费: /v1/charge/cid, /lease/grant)\\n  │              │\\n  │              └── WebSocket ──► Client  (NtfGameStatus 通知)\\n  │\\n  └── 辅助服务 (同老系统，GSM / 存档 / 排队等不变)\\n```\\n\\n## 通信协议总结\\n\\n| 方向 | 协议 | 用途 |\\n|------|------|------|\\n| union-access → cgsession | gRPC | 调度入口 (UserApplyAdapter, UserStateAdapter 等) |\\n| cgsession → sched-hub | gRPC | 调度请求 (Schedule) |\\n| sched-hub → cgsession | Kafka | 调度结果异步回传 (schedule_result_topic) |\\n| cgsession → cgvmagent | HTTP | 启停游戏 (/v1/cgagent/game/startGame, /endGame) |\\n| cgsession → charge | HTTP | 计费 (/v1/charge/cid, /lease/grant) |\\n| cgsession → Client | WebSocket | 游戏状态推送 (NtfGameStatus) |\\n\\n## 完整调度时序（6 个阶段）\\n\\n```\\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\\n阶段一：入口 (union-access)\\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\\nClient → union-access /v3/union/apply\\n  ├── NetProps.resolveV4ByLocal       → 解析客户端 IP/ISP\\n  ├── UserRepo.Register               → 注册用户\\n  ├── dlock.redislock(LockUser)       → 分布式锁\\n  ├── gRPC → cgsession.UserStateAdapter → 查询用户状态\\n  ├── gRPC → cgarchive.CheckArchiveMove → 检查存档迁移\\n  ├── gRPC → cgsession.UserApplyAdapter → ★ 核心调度入口\\n  └── gorm.Create → 创建 DB 记录\\n\\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\\n阶段二：cgsession 调度入口\\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\\ncgsession.UserApplyAdapter (入口)\\n  ├── GetSession          → 从 Redis 获取 session\\n  ├── InitSession         → 初始化 session 数据\\n  ├── sessionBiz.Apply\\n  │     └── firstApply (首次申请)\\n  │           ├── resourceBiz.schedule\\n  │           │     └── scheduleBiz.Schedule  → gRPC: sched-hub.Schedule\\n  │           ├── HTTP → charge /v1/charge/cid  → 创建计费 ID\\n  │           ├── tokenBiz.applyAToken          → 申请区域 Token\\n  │           ├── AddSessionCheckTask           → 启动定时检查任务\\n  │           └── saveSession                   → 写 Redis\\n  └── (可选) PreLaunch → LaunchGame → cgvmagent.startGame\\n\\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\\n阶段三：sched-hub 调度决策\\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\\ncgsession → gRPC → sched-hub.ScheduleService/Schedule\\n  输入参数:\\n    - 用户信息: uuid, ISP, 省市, 设备类型, 分辨率\\n    - 游戏信息: gid, archive 优先 IDC\\n    - 调度策略: areaType, rSetId, specId, images, idcList\\n  调度决策\\n  └── Kafka produce → schedule_result_topic\\n        返回: VMID, scheduleId, streamIpv4Address, areaType, idc\\n\\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\\n阶段四：Kafka 异步回调 → 出队启动游戏\\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\\ncgsession Kafka Consumer (schedule_result_topic)\\n  ScheduleResultNotifyService.Consume\\n  ├── GetSession                       → 获取 session\\n  ├── scheduleBiz.processScheduleResponse → 写入 VM 信息到 flow cache\\n  │     (areaType, imageVersion, IDC, VMID, Region, MgrIpv4Address)\\n  ├── saveSession                      → 持久化\\n  └── userDequeue\\n        └── LaunchGame\\n              └── HTTP → cgvmagent /v1/cgagent/game/startGame\\n                    参数: vmid, scheduleId, streamIpv4Address, areaType, idc\\n\\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\\n阶段五：通知客户端\\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\\ncgsession.MessageBiz.SendNotify\\n  └── WebSocket → Client: NtfGameStatus\\n        game_status=1 (GameStatusAllocSuccess)\\n        resource_ipv4_address, vmid\\n\\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\\n阶段六：计费续约（后台周期性）\\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\\ncgsession → charge /v1/charge/lease/grant  (granted_duration=60s)\\ncgsession → charge /v1/charge/lease/grant  (granted_duration=240s)\\n后续每 ~30s  周期性续约...\\n```\\n\\n## 关键代码位置\\n\\n| 功能 | 文件 | 关键函数/行号 |\\n|------|------|--------------|\\n| union-access 适配 | `union-access/application/integration/cgsession.go` | `cgSessionAdapterFacade` → gRPC 调用 cgsession |\\n| cgsession 入口 | `rock-stack/apps/cgsession/internal/service/adapter.go:18` | `UserApplyAdapter()` |\\n| Apply 主流程 | `rock-stack/apps/cgsession/internal/biz/session.go` | `Apply()` / `firstApply()` / `LaunchGame()` / `userDequeue()` |\\n| 调度请求构造 | `rock-stack/apps/cgsession/internal/biz/schedule.go` | `Schedule()` → gRPC: sched-hub.Schedule |\\n| 资源策略 | `rock-stack/apps/cgsession/internal/biz/resource.go` | `resourceBiz.schedule()` 策略模式 |\\n| Kafka 消费调度结果 | `rock-stack/apps/cgsession/internal/service/schedule_result_notify.go:90` | `ScheduleResultNotifyService.Consume()` → `ProcessNotifyScheduleResponse()` |\\n| sched-hub 调度 | sched-hub (独立仓库) | `/schedule.hub.v2.ScheduleService/Schedule` |\\n| 通知客户端 | `rock-stack/apps/cgsession/internal/biz/` | `MessageBiz.SendNotify()` → `NtfGameStatus` |\\n\\n## 新旧系统对比\\n\\n| 维度 | 新系统 | 老系统 |\\n|------|--------|…[truncated]","seq":11,"step":3,"toolName":"read_skill_file","truncated":true},{"kind":"model","messageCount":14,"mode":"tools_stream","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","phase":"responded","seq":12,"step":4},{"allowed":true,"arguments":{"body":"{\"query\":{\"bool\":{\"should\":[{\"query_string\":{\"query\":\"\\\"4103_TMuvu0uu5v2E\\\"\",\"default_field\":\"M\"}},{\"match_phrase\":{\"flow_id\":\"4103_TMuvu0uu5v2E\"}},{\"match_phrase\":{\"trace_id\":\"4103_TMuvu0uu5v2E\"}}]}},\"size\":200,\"sort\":[{\"@timestamp\":\"asc\"}]}","headers":{"Content-Type":"application/json"},"method":"POST","url":"http://10.137.211.84:29200/backend-cgsession-*,backend-sched-hub-*,backend-sched-planner-*,backend-union-access-*,backend-union_resource-*,backend-vm_manager-*/_search"},"decision":"allowed","durationMs":278,"id":"call_e74c7f1b4b444557a49f2cea","kind":"tool","phase":"completed","result"